# money

`#import "shop/money"`

Amounts of money, kept in whole cents so that adding them up
never drifts.

    #import "shop/money"
    print money.Format( money.Cents( 1999 ) )

## Contents

- **Types:** [Amount](#amount)
- **Procedures:** [Cents](#cents) · [Format](#format)

## Types

<a id="amount"></a>

### Amount

```freebasic
type Amount
```

An amount of money.

| Member | |
|---|---|
| `as int64 cents` | negative for money owed |

*money.tiko:9*

## Procedures

<a id="cents"></a>

### Cents

```freebasic
function Cents( byval n as int64 ) as Amount
```

An amount of 'n' cents.

*money.tiko:14*

<a id="format"></a>

### Format

```freebasic
function Format( byref a as Amount ) as ustring
```

The amount as text with two decimals: 19.99.

*money.tiko:17*
